.azure/

# =============================================================================
# Final Notes
# =============================================================================
#
# Best Practices:
# 1. Always exclude sensitive files like .env, certificates, keys
# 2. Exclude development-only files to reduce image size
# 3. Use specific patterns rather than broad wildcards when possible
# 4. Regularly review and update exclusions based on project evolution
# 5. Test build context size with: docker build --no-cache --progress=plain
#
# Security Reminders:
# - Never include secrets, API keys, or sensitive configuration
# - Exclude private keys, certificates, and authentication files
# - Review the build context before pushing to registries
#
# =============================================================================